    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The game blends a variety of gameplay elements:<br>Rogue-like growth and strategic choices, freely placeable tower defense, individual control combined with squad control, and automatic team management.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Intense multi-versus-multi battles</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Numerous soldiers and fighters fill the battlefield with combat, and commanders need to promptly identify and reinforce areas that require more troops.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3503530/extras/12c7b6b78aee68058b652522c10e73a2.poster.avif?t=1750495215\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3503530/extras/12c7b6b78aee68058b652522c10e73a2.webm?t=1750495215\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3503530/extras/12c7b6b78aee68058b652522c10e73a2.mp4?t=1750495215\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Free squad control</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players take on the role of commanders, allowing them to control themselves and direct their squads. They can also set the defense and attack targets for up to five squads simultaneously.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3503530/extras/57019e8ca173753e6c3de9a7db13bfbd.poster.avif?t=1750495215\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3503530/extras/57019e8ca173753e6c3de9a7db13bfbd.webm?t=1750495215\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3503530/extras/57019e8ca173753e6c3de9a7db13bfbd.mp4?t=1750495215\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Forming factions: Soldiers/Turrets/Fighters/Warships</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Configure strategy pools; by selecting different strategy pools, players gain reinforcement strategies from the chosen pool each round. Different strategies lead to distinct faction styles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3503530/extras/c92fd64549954a41a2464f7c7bc1af95.poster.avif?t=1750495215\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3503530/extras/c92fd64549954a41a2464f7c7bc1af95.webm?t=1750495215\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3503530/extras/c92fd64549954a41a2464f7c7bc1af95.mp4?t=1750495215\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Distinctive Levels/Enemies/Bosses</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each level features unique enemies and different Bosses. After clearing the game, there's also an infinite challenge mode.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3503530/extras/63c61f74bfd228019fc00bb3d1513760.poster.avif?t=1750495215\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3503530/extras/63c61f74bfd228019fc00bb3d1513760.webm?t=1750495215\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3503530/extras/63c61f74bfd228019fc00bb3d1513760.mp4?t=1750495215\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The game blends a variety of gameplay elements:<br>Rogue-like growth and strategic choices, freely placeable tower defense, individual control combined with squad control, and automatic team management.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Intense multi-versus-multi battles</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Numerous soldiers and fighters fill the battlefield with combat, and commanders need to promptly identify and reinforce areas that require more troops.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3503530/extras/12c7b6b78aee68058b652522c10e73a2.poster.avif?t=1750495215\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3503530/extras/12c7b6b78aee68058b652522c10e73a2.webm?t=1750495215\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3503530/extras/12c7b6b78aee68058b652522c10e73a2.mp4?t=1750495215\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Free squad control</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players take on the role of commanders, allowing them to control themselves and direct their squads. They can also set the defense and attack targets for up to five squads simultaneously.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3503530/extras/57019e8ca173753e6c3de9a7db13bfbd.poster.avif?t=1750495215\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3503530/extras/57019e8ca173753e6c3de9a7db13bfbd.webm?t=1750495215\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3503530/extras/57019e8ca173753e6c3de9a7db13bfbd.mp4?t=1750495215\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Forming factions: Soldiers/Turrets/Fighters/Warships</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Configure strategy pools; by selecting different strategy pools, players gain reinforcement strategies from the chosen pool each round. Different strategies lead to distinct faction styles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3503530/extras/c92fd64549954a41a2464f7c7bc1af95.poster.avif?t=1750495215\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3503530/extras/c92fd64549954a41a2464f7c7bc1af95.webm?t=1750495215\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3503530/extras/c92fd64549954a41a2464f7c7bc1af95.mp4?t=1750495215\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Distinctive Levels/Enemies/Bosses</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each level features unique enemies and different Bosses. After clearing the game, there's also an infinite challenge mode.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3503530/extras/63c61f74bfd228019fc00bb3d1513760.poster.avif?t=1750495215\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3503530/extras/63c61f74bfd228019fc00bb3d1513760.webm?t=1750495215\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3503530/extras/63c61f74bfd228019fc00bb3d1513760.mp4?t=1750495215\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
